load @term/seed/code/manifold/riemannian
  find riemannian-manifold

# A sub-Riemannian manifold: a manifold where motion is allowed only along certain directions at each point (a
# distribution), with distance measured along admissible paths, the geometry of constrained motion. A parking car and
# the carrying of quantum phase are sub-Riemannian. The form carries the underlying Riemannian manifold; the constraint
# on admissible directions is the added structure.
form sub-riemannian-manifold
  link manifold, like riemannian-manifold
